  "about": "Gemini CLI asks \"Allow execution of [Shell]?\" and you allow it: the command is the agent's.",
  "start": "2026-11-12T10:00",
  "steps": [
    {
      "at": 0,
      "app": "Warp",
      "bundle": "dev.warp.Warp-Stable",
